## S1d REQ-E1: replay and expiry attacks refused

Attacks against the INTACT validator (RED = the attack direction, which
must fail; restore is a no-op — GREEN = still refused):

```
auth-envelope: authorized (a1b2c3d4e5f60718 scope src/include/hash.h; actor still performs the landing)
auth-envelope: refused (replayed envelope (nonce already consumed))
auth-envelope: refused (envelope expired)
S1d first presentation -> authorized
S1d REPLAYED nonce -> refused
